# Blog Comment
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Blog — a visitor comment, moderated before it appears publicly
# Case 13 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: blog-post.menata
#
# A second instance of the public-access finding: the commenter is a Visitor, not a
# User — no CAP-F05 identity exists for them at all, only a freely entered name/email.

Comment

Fields

- Post : Post
- Visitor Name : Text
- Visitor Email : Text
- Body : Rich Text
- Posted At : Date
- Status : Pending | Approved

Constraints

- Post is required.
- Visitor Name is required.
- Body is required.

Permissions

Visitor

- Submit

Author

- Approve

Views

- Post Comments : List
- Pending Comments : List
